---
// EthicsPriceBots: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 320;
---
<figure class="epb">
  <div class="epb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Four steps: both stations adopt bots, one bot cuts its price, the rival bot punishes the cut, both learn discounts do not pay. Result: margins about 28 percent higher in duopolies where both adopted.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>How two pricing bots learn to keep prices high</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai bot định giá học cách giữ giá cao ra sao</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>German retail gasoline after pricing software spread around 2017 (Assad, Clark, Ershov and Xu).</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xăng bán lẻ ở Đức sau khi phần mềm định giá lan rộng quanh năm 2017 (Assad, Clark, Ershov, Xu).</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="76" width="190" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={44} y={111} size={24} />
      <text x="66" y="106" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Both stations</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cả hai trạm cùng</tspan></text>
      <text x="66" y="124" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>adopt pricing bots</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dùng bot định giá</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 210 111 L 238.0 111.0" /><polygon points="243,111 236.7,114.0 236.7,108.0" /></g>
      <rect x="243" y="76" width="190" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={267} y={111} size={24} />
      <text x="289" y="106" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>One bot</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một bot hạ</tspan></text>
      <text x="289" y="124" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>cuts its price</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giá bán</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 433 111 L 461.0 111.0" /><polygon points="466,111 459.7,114.0 459.7,108.0" /></g>
      <rect x="466" y="76" width="190" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="retry" x={490} y={111} size={24} />
      <text x="512" y="106" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Rival bot</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bot đối thủ</tspan></text>
      <text x="512" y="124" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>punishes the cut</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trả đũa ngay</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 656 111 L 684.0 111.0" /><polygon points="689,111 682.7,114.0 682.7,108.0" /></g>
      <rect x="689" y="76" width="190" height="70" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="lock" x={713} y={111} size={24} />
      <text x="735" y="106" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Both learn that</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cả hai học được</tspan></text>
      <text x="735" y="124" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>discounts do not pay</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giảm giá là thiệt</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 450 146 L 450.0 181.0" /><polygon points="450,186 447.0,179.7 453.0,179.7" /></g>
      <rect x="20" y="186" width="860" height="92" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={54} y={232} size={28} />
      <text x="88" y="222" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Margins about 28% higher in duopolies where both stations adopted</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biên lợi nhuận cao hơn khoảng 28% ở thị trường hai trạm cùng dùng bot</tspan></text>
      <text x="88" y="244" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>About 9% higher across non-monopoly markets overall.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khoảng 9% ở mọi thị trường không độc quyền.</tspan></text>
      <text x="88" y="264" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>The owners never phoned each other: the bots learned it.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chủ trạm không hề gọi nhau: bot tự học ra.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Nobody agreed anything. Each bot only learned that a discount gets punished, so neither tries one.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Không ai thỏa thuận gì. Mỗi bot chỉ học được rằng giảm giá sẽ bị trả đũa, nên không bên nào thử.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .epb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .epb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .epb svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .epb text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .epb .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .epb .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .epb .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .epb .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .epb .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .epb .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .epb .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .epb .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .epb .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .epb .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .epb .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .epb .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .epb .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .epb .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .epb .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .epb .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .epb .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .epb .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .epb .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .epb .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .epb .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .epb .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .epb .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .epb figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
